<!-- The arwb adversary-complaint Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs; docs/EVAL-LOOP.md,
     "Cross-engine gate") in the face of the typst template ({font}) at 13 pt (size 26 half points; the template's
     size, ADV-FORM-001); Body Text in exact 24 pt line boxes (typst pitch-body, double spacing) with a half-inch
     first-line indent (typst para-indent); single lines 15.6 pt (typst pitch-single); letter page, 1 in margins.
     Every paragraph of the document is written by docx/arwb-adversary-complaint.lua with its own spacing (the typst
     values, twips = 20 x pt). The footer is the page number as "- n -" (typst page-footer, the form of the filed
     exemplar), under its own relationship id, which the section names in place of the recipe's plain number; its line is a single-pitch box, and w:footer
     (695 twips) puts it where typst sets the footer (page-footer, footer-descent 30 %; fb diff --engines baselines). -->
